VRChat 계정이 있으면 {{VRC link|https://feedback.vrchat.com|feedback.vrchat.com}}에서 가명으로 버그를 신고할 수 있습니다. 이 사이트는 Canny.io 기반 티켓 시스템을 쓰고, VRChat은 별도의 내부 시스템으로 티켓을 관리하고 추적합니다. VRChat 2026.3.1부터는 퀵 메뉴의 같은 신고(!) 버튼에서 "버그 신고"를 골라 게임 안에서도 버그를 신고할 수 있습니다.<ref>[https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202631 VRChat 2026.3.1] (''docs.vrchat.com'')</ref>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
===Template for reports<ref>[https://www.twitch.tv/vrchat/clip/SaltyAssiduousEchidnaAMPEnergy-TNqOCjdrYDHegiw9 What a Bug Report needs - Q&A Team StormRel] <!-- fallback video: https://youtu.be/YusV-Atlhog --></ref>===
</div>

 <div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
1. Summary
 > Explain in 2-3 Sentence what this report is about.
 VRChat crashed when trying to join a friend.
</div>

 <div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
2. Steps to reproduce the bug:
 > Write down what you did step by step so someone else can see the problem. For example:
   1. Open Main Menu
   2. Visit any Profile
   3. Double Click "Join" Button
</div>

 <div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
3. What did you expect to happen?
 > Explain what you thought would happen. For example:
 To join my friends.
</div>

 <div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
4. What actually happened?
 > Explain what went wrong. For example:
 VRChat crashed.
</div>

 <div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
X. Additional details (if any):
 > Add any other information. For example:
 * Logs (`%appdata%\..\LocalLow\VRChat\VRChat\`, need to be uploaded external)
 * Video (up to 8MB, or can be uploaded externally, [https://studio.youtube.com/channel/%20/videos/upload?d=ud upload on YouTube])
 * Screenshots (up to 8MB, or can be uploaded externally)
 * Links
</div>

